#: assets/js/livqacea-prepublish.js:146
msgid ""
"1 image missing alternative text (alt). Screen reader users will not be able "
"to perceive the image content (WCAG 1.1.1)."
msgstr ""
"1 张图片缺少替代文本（alt）。屏幕阅读器用户将无法感知图片内容（WCAG 1.1.1）。"

#: assets/js/livqacea-prepublish.js:147
msgid ""
"images missing alternative text (alt). Screen reader users will not be able "
"to perceive the content (WCAG 1.1.1)."
msgstr ""
"张图片缺少替代文本（alt）。屏幕阅读器用户将无法感知内容（WCAG 1.1.1）。"

#: assets/js/livqacea-prepublish.js:172
msgid ""
"1 link uses a URL as clickable text. Replace the URL with a meaningful "
"description of the action or destination (WCAG 2.4.4)."
msgstr ""
"1 个链接使用 URL 作为可点击文本。请将 URL 替换为对操作或目标的有意义描述"
"（WCAG 2.4.4）。"

#: assets/js/livqacea-prepublish.js:173
msgid ""
"links use a URL as clickable text. Replace them with meaningful descriptions "
"(WCAG 2.4.4)."
msgstr ""
"个链接使用 URL 作为可点击文本。请将它们替换为有意义的描述（WCAG 2.4.4）。"

